<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Choosing to trade <em>independently.</em></h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>As I considered the direction I wanted my life to take, I decided that trading independently was a better fit for me. It offered the freedom to develop my own approach and build my working life around my priorities, while taking responsibility for my own decisions.</p>
