<!-- wp:group {"className":"head rise","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group head rise">
<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Approaching a market with a <em>plan.</em></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The aim is to help you understand how to approach these markets with a plan, before any money is at risk.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"className":"steps3","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group steps3">
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"article","className":"step3 glass tilt rise","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<article class="wp-block-group step3 glass tilt rise">
<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"n"} -->
<p class="n">01</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">What to look for</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The structure, levels and conditions that make gold and silver worth watching on a given day.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
</article>
<!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"article","className":"step3 glass tilt rise","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<article class="wp-block-group step3 glass tilt rise">
<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"n"} -->
<p class="n">02</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">How to assess an opportunity</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Weigh a potential setup against your plan, the wider context and how clearly the chart supports it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
</article>
